# sibling working copy: the fork-map SPA (github.com/gpui-archipelago/map),
# cloned in so both repos can be edited side by side. This site never builds or
# imports it; ignoring it also keeps Tailwind v4 from scanning its sources.
/map/

# sibling working copy: the corpus repo (github.com/gpui-archipelago/gpui-corpus),
# whose curation/research/*.md are the published study docs the fork map's
# reader renders. Cloned in for authoring passes; the map fetches from here with
# GPUI_CORPUS_DIR=<this> scripts/fetch-docs.sh. Never built or imported.
/gpui-corpus/
